{"content":[{"c":["BAVVAI*"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["Individual who directed the repair of a section of the Jerusalem wall under Nehemiah’s supervision (",{"href":"?bref=Neh.3.18","r":"Neh.3.18","rawR":"Neh.3.18","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Neh.3.18","value":"Neh.3.18"}],"t":"ref","v":"Neh 3:18"},"). Bavvai was Henadad’s son and the official of half the district of Keilah, a town 17 miles (27.4 kilometers) southwest of Jerusalem. Binnui (",{"href":"?bref=Neh.3.24","r":"Neh.3.24","rawR":"Neh.3.24","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Neh.3.24","value":"Neh.3.24"}],"t":"ref","v":"Neh 3:24"},"), also mentioned as Henadad’s son (cf. ",{"href":"?bref=Ezra.3.9","r":"Ezra.3.9","rawR":"Ezra.3.9","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ezra.3.9","value":"Ezra.3.9"}],"t":"ref","v":"Ezr 3:9"},"), may be a corrupted spelling of Bavvai, or the two may have been brothers. ",{"c":["See"],"sourceClass":"ital","t":"span"}," ",{"href":"?item=Binnui_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","id":"Binnui_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","rawId":"Binnui_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","t":"link","v":"Binnui #4"},"."],"sourceClass":"fl","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"Bavvai","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"Neh 3:18","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Neh.3.18","rawQueryValue":"Neh.3.18","sourceRefExact":"Neh.3.18"},{"anchorText":"Neh 3:24","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Neh.3.24","rawQueryValue":"Neh.3.24","sourceRefExact":"Neh.3.24"},{"anchorText":"Ezr 3:9","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Ezra.3.9","rawQueryValue":"Ezra.3.9","sourceRefExact":"Ezra.3.9"}],"sourceItemFragmentSha256":"d9704977abc854046168628b85d94ac695ef7857f1449e74c81e182150edfcef","sourceItemName":"Bavvai","sourceItemOrder":112,"sourceMember":"Articles/B.xml","supplementPointersNotIncludedAsContent":[]},"sourceAttributes":{"name":"Bavvai","product":"TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","typename":"Article"},"sourceTitleExact":"Bavvai*","title":"Bavvai*","version":"v2-a101d843a2f0cd3fc0c6"}